# Fault F1 (W-A): a sum over unit-kind leg amounts was refused `LOAD-UNIT 0 funds and 90 glb`. L §3.2 A key that load
# can't see: "A 0 with no key (a bare 0, a sum over no keys ...) takes the key of what it meets", so the sum of the
# one buy of 90 glb is 90 glb (q); "values in two keys of K that meet in ... a sum's terms ... are refused (RUN-DOMAIN)":
# 90 glb and 10 eur together (q2).
=== m.tally
model t13
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-15
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source src "s"
kind funds: unit
kind buys: event certain
  leg units: funds
place h: holdings glb lives 2026-01-01..
place h2: holdings eur lives 2026-01-01..
place mk: outside lives 2000-01-01..
input b: observed
ask q: sum(o.units.amount for o in buys over 2026-01) law 2026-06-30
ask q2: sum(o.units.amount for o in buys over 2026) law 2026-06-30
version v
  cite src
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  funds + [glb, eur] lives 2018-01-01..
  b[r1] = (on: 2026-01-05, kind: buys, leg units from mk to h amount 90 glb) "r1"
  b[r2] = (on: 2026-02-05, kind: buys, leg units from mk to h2 amount 10 eur) "r2"
=== expect
q: 90 glb
  law date 2026-06-30, cut 2026-01-15
q2: refused: RUN-DOMAIN ...
  law date 2026-06-30, cut 2026-01-15
